  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#script-nomodule-example\r\n\r\n> &lt;script type=​\"module\" src=​\"app\\.mjs\"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;\r\n> &lt;script nomodule src=​\"classic\\-app\\-bundle\\.mjs\"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;\r\n\r\nI think \"nomodule\" should not be `.mjs` — extension and context imply certain mime types which can be confusing",
